   "title": "Design & hull",
   "intro": "A true milestone in the 50-year history of Solaris Yachts. A vision of light, lines, and design gliding across the sea: cutting-edge technology, maximum comfort, record-breaking performance. Everything a Solaris owner dreams of, demands, and gets.\nFull carbon hull and deck, lifting keel, carbon appendages, carbon mast and boom with carbon rigging.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
