  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Interiors",
   "intro": "The revolutionary exterior is complemented by walnut interiors with precious finishes. A highly elegant owner’s cabin, designed at the stern with private access directly from a large separate cockpit.\nInnovative design, many hours of labor, and skilled craftsmen and technicians always ready to come up with new solutions have made it possible to create this 33-meter yacht: not just a top-of-the-range yacht, but an experience of knowledge, shared values, and the awareness of being part of the history of Solaris Yachts, in the past and in the future, today and for another 50 years together.",
